    "description": "<p>Your arm becomes an elongated tendril that can attack or manipulate objects.</p><p>Choose yourself or a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, the target gains the following attack.</p><blockquote><p><strong>Grasping Tendril:</strong> Melee, 2 + ES Damage, Range 3, Magical, Restraining, Bludgeoning</p></blockquote><p>Additionally, the tendril can grasp and manipulate objects within <strong>3 spaces </strong>of the user, as if they were using their own hands.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.3orRy0QMlPUmc3d7]{Grasping Tendril}</p>",
